From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:40:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: Expose the H616 DE33 CDC as a plane color pipeline

The DE33 VI channels 0 and 1 have a colour conversion unit (CDC) that
the vendor BSP uses for HDR <-> SDR and gamut conversion: an input CSC,
a 17x17x17 3D LUT and an output CSC on channel 0, the 3D LUT alone on
channel 1.

Expose it as the plane color pipeline 3x4 matrix, 3D LUT, 3x4 matrix
(3D LUT only on channel 1). YCbCr planes are converted to R'G'B' by the
input CSC with the plane's encoding and range and back by the output
CSC, so the channel CSC is unchanged. Channel 1 has no CSC and rejects
an active LUT on YCbCr planes. Unchanged register words are not
rewritten, so a page flip does not reload the 4913 LUT entries.

The register layout and the LUT bank order follow the vendor BSP
(de_cdc.c, de_cdc_table.c); the user manual does not document the DE.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile         |   1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_cdc.c     | 481 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_cdc.h     |  19 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_planes.c  |   2 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_csc.c      |  17 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_csc.h      |   2 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.h    |   6 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_vi_layer.c |  23 +-
 8 files changed, 547 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_cdc.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_cdc.h

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile
index 01422c2e3..80fe29480 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ sun8i-drm-hdmi-y		+= sun8i_hdmi_phy.o
 sun8i-drm-hdmi-y		+= sun8i_hdmi_phy_clk.o
 
 sun8i-mixer-y			+= sun50i_afbc.o
+sun8i-mixer-y			+= sun50i_cdc.o
 sun8i-mixer-y			+= sun50i_shadow.o
 sun8i-mixer-y			+= sun50i_wb.o
